47:["$", "$e", "2", {"children": ["$", "$La", null, {"componentKey": "bd8c728a-84bf-4b57-b14a-5bdef5dadfba", "viewTrackingSpecs": {"viewName": "feed-commentary"}, "children": ["$", "div", null, {"componentkey": "bd8c728a-84bf-4b57-b14a-5bdef5dadfba", "children": [["$", "$e", "0", {"children": ["$", "$La", null, {"componentKey": "translatable-commentary-FeTranslationUrn(contentUrnCommentUrn=null, contentUrnGroupPostUrn=ContentUrnGroupPostUrn(groupPostUrn=GroupPostUrn(groupId=16179129, postId=7529113090341347328)), contentUrnShareUrn=null, contentUrnUgcPostUrn=null, detectedLocale=, targetLocale=en)", "children": ["$", "$L14", "translatable-commentary-FeTranslationUrn(contentUrnCommentUrn=null, contentUrnGroupPostUrn=ContentUrnGroupPostUrn(groupPostUrn=GroupPostUrn(groupId=16179129, postId=7529113090341347328)), contentUrnShareUrn=null, contentUrnUgcPostUrn=null, detectedLocale=, targetLocale=en)", {"componentKey": "translatable-commentary-FeTranslationUrn(contentUrnCommentUrn=null, contentUrnGroupPostUrn=ContentUrnGroupPostUrn(groupPostUrn=GroupPostUrn(groupId=16179129, postId=7529113090341347328)), contentUrnShareUrn=null, contentUrnUgcPostUrn=null, detectedLocale=, targetLocale=en)", "initialContent": ["$", "$La", null, {"componentKey": "785175c5-9781-4bde-9478-ce09c955850e", "viewTrackingSpecs": {"viewName": "feed-commentary"}, "children": ["$", "$L5c", null, {"textProps": {"fontFamily": "sans", "fontSize": "small", "fontStyle": "normal", "fontWeight": "normal", "lineHeight": "custom", "textAlign": "start", "children": [["$", "$e", "text-attr-0", {"children": [[null, [["$", "$e", "0", {"children": [null, "¿Quién responde cuando un agente de IA mueve dinero o sufre un ataque?"]}], ["$", "$e", "1", {"children": [["$", "br", null, {}], ""]}], ["$", "$e", "2", {"children": [["$", "br", null, {}], "Esta semana, Citibank actualizó sus términos de servicio con una definición contundente: los clientes asumen la responsabilidad por los problemas, errores, fraudes o transacciones ejecutadas mediante herramientas de inteligencia artificial de terceros utilizadas para finanzas personales, incluso si la cuenta resulta comprometida por un hackeo.  "]}], ["$", "$e", "3", {"children": [["$", "br", null, {}], "No es un caso aislado. "]}], ["$", "$e", "4", {"children": [["$", "br", null, {}], ""]}], ["$", "$e", "5", {"children": [["$", "br", null, {}], "Entidades como JPMorgan, Bank of America y PNC ya avanzaron en políticas similares frente al avance de asistentes automatizados que reciben credenciales para analizar gastos, sugerir inversiones, pagar facturas o iniciar movimientos de fondos.  "]}], ["$", "$e", "6", {"children": [["$", "br", null, {}], ""]}], ["$", "$e", "7", {"children": [["$", "br", null, {}], "Desde la experiencia operativa y de control en la industria financiera, este movimiento abre varios debates clave para el ecosistema:"]}], ["$", "$e", "8", {"children": [["$", "br", null, {}], ""]}], ["$", "$e", "9", {"children": [["$", "br", null, {}], "Viñeta Gestión del riesgo y delegación de credenciales: entregar claves o permisos a agentes externos de IA rompe esquemas tradicionales de autenticación y trazabilidad. Cuando algo falla, la frontera entre error del algoritmo, brecha de seguridad del tercero y negligencia del usuario se vuelve difusa.  "]}], ["$", "$e", "10", {"children": [["$", "br", null, {}], ""]}], ["$", "$e", "11", {"children": [["$", "br", null, {}], "Viñeta Cobertura y seguros: ¿cómo se redefinen las coberturas de fraude, ciberriesgo y responsabilidad frente a operaciones automatizadas no autorizadas o mal ejecutadas por un agente intermediario?"]}], "$Ldf", "$Le0", "$Le1", "$Le2", "$Le3"], "$Le4"], "$Le5", "$Le6"]}], "$Le7", "$Le8", "$Le9", "$Lea", "$Leb", "$Lec", "$Led"], "componentkey": "785175c5-9781-4bde-9478-ce09c955850e", "linkHoverDecoration": "underline", "lineClamp": 3, "hasShowMore": false, "expandButtonText": "more", "shouldCollapseNewLines": false, "noopOverride": false}, "bindingKey": {"key": {"